# Used by `docker build -f server/Dockerfile .` (context = repository root).
# Send only what the image needs. Env files, keys and local data never go in.
*
!frontend
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
!server/pyproject.toml
!server/uv.lock
!server/README.md
!server/src
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
